Deep Learning (Neural Network NN)
  -input->weight/values...n->output
  -every single neurons is making computation to generate output.
  
Forward and backward propagation concept.
Forward - guss/predict

backward - adjust / learning from mistakes
  -output->hidden layers -> make adjustments in neuron (values/logic)-> output

