Types of Neural Networks Architecture.
  1) Feed Forward Neural Network (FNN)
      -input-logic/neurons/weight->output
  2) Recurrent Neural Network (RNN)
      -mostly used memory to go back into previous neurons logic to find another context (eg - raj is very happy) - in this happy is context but after that we need another context who is happy to find that we need to go back the previous neurons
  3) Convolutional Neural Network (CNN)
      -grid format 
      -mostly used for read images for prediction
